>  <SELECTION_REASON>
Manually reviewed Lewis representation. The Fe tricarbonyl, Dur, two iPr groups and N(SiMe₃)₂ each match published compound 7iPr. The authors assign the endocyclic B–carbene C bond as single in Figures 3 and 4 and note delocalization. Input B0–C4 1.598 Å, WBO 0.848; Retain the single bond, N3⁺=C4⁻ represents a neutral closed-shell carbene. Localized 6 aromatic-ring bonds using WBOs and original bond lengths. The atom order and coordinates of all 82 atoms agree between XYZ and SDF. Lengths of 79 nonmetal covalent bonds: 70 within range, 0 outside range and 9 with sparse controls. Use the supplied Lewis representation for scoring; Independent evidence for the complete graph is limited.

